#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, reducerLabel)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/auxiliary/opticaltrains.ui:229
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Select if any reducer or barlow is used in the train.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Reducer:</span> If the value is less than 1.0x, this element is considered as a reducer (focal length is decreased by this factor).</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Barlow</span>: If the value is over 1.0x, then it is considered a barlow element (focal length is increased by this factor).</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Seleccione se usar un factor redutor ou de Barlow no tren.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Redutor:</span> se o valor é menor que ×1.0, o elemento considérase un redutor (a distancia focal diminúese ao aplicar o factor).</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">De Barlow</span>: se o valor é maior que ×1.0, o elemento considérase de Barlow (a distancia focal auméntase ao aplicar o factor).</p>"
"</body></html>"

