#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:230
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The current pierside of the mount. A red frame indicates an unknown pierside. This is normal if the mount is parked. </p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O lado de observación actual da montura. O marco vermello indica un lado de observación descoñecido. Isto é normal cando a montura está estacionada.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:233
#, kde-format
msgid "Current Pierside"
msgstr "Lado de observación actual"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, MountPierside)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:257
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Current pierside of the mount</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Lado de observación actual da montura</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, CameraOffset)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:289
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Camera offset angle</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Ángulo de desprazamento da cámara</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_6)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:333
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Flip Policy</span> determines how the rotator reacts after a flip or if the result of a solved reference image reports a different pierside respective to the actual mount pierside.</p>"
"<p>Flip Policy can be altered in <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Align Options</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> under &quot;Rotator Settings&quot;.</span></p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Política de volta</span> determina como reacciona o rotor tras unha volta ou se o resultado dunha imaxe de referencia resolta ten un lado de observación distinto do real da montura.</p>"
"<p>A política de volta pode modificarse nas <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Opcións de aliñamento</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> en «Configuración do rotor».</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_6)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:336
#, kde-format
msgid "Flip Policy"
msgstr "Política de volta"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, RotatorAngle)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:358
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Raw rotator Angle</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Ángulo en bruto do rotor</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:382
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The raw rotator full circle angle of the rotator device, which is calculated as the difference of the rotator origin (zero angle) respective to North on pierside WEST or respective to South on pierside EAST.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O ángulo de círculo completo en bruto do rotor, que se calcula como a diferenza entre a orixe do rotor (ángulo cero) e o norte no lado de observación oeste ou o sur no lado de observación leste.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:385
#, kde-format
msgid "Rotator Angle"
msgstr "Ángulo do rotor"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:397
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The angle of the camera upright direction (see FOV) respective to the rotator origin direction. The camera offset is determined automatically by a <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Capture &amp; Solve</span> or a <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Load &amp; Slew</span> in the Align module. </p>"
"<p>The camera offset is measured in position angle scope (-179.99° to 180.00°).</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O ángulo da dirección cara arriba da cámara (consulte o campo de visión) con respecto á dirección de orixe do rotor. O desprazamento da cámara determínase automaticamente con <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Capturar e resolver</span> ou <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Cargar e mover</span> no módulo de aliñamento. </p>"
"<p>O desprazamento da cámara mídese no alcance do ángulo de posición (de -179,99° a 180,00°).</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:449
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Setting the camera position angle shall move the rotator. The gauge reflects the state of the rotator. Depending on the accuracy of the rotator there can be some deviation in the ending position angle.</p>"
"<p>The position angle is measured East of North in degrees.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Definir o ángulo de posición da cámara move o rotor. O calibrador amosa o estado do rotor. Segundo a precisión do rotor, pode que exista algo de desviación no ángulo de posición final.</p>"
"<p>O ángulo de posición mídese en graos nordeste.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:452
#, kde-format
msgid "Camera Position Angle"
msgstr "Ángulo de posición da cámara"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, CameraPA)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:471
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Current Camera Position Angle</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Ángulo de posición actual da cámara.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, reverseDirection)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/capture/rotatorsettings.ui:557
#, kde-format
msgid "Reverse Direction of Rotator"
msgstr "Inverter a dirección do rotor."

