#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusAFOverscan)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocusmechanics.ui:232
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Provides backlash overscan in ticks for outward focuser movements during an Autofocus run. This is in addition to any Driver Backlash provided by the device driver and set in the Driver Backlash field. Set to 0 to disable. </p>"
"<p>If set, AF Overscan is applied to all focuser movements initiated by the Focus module.</p>"
"<p>Typically either Focuser Backlash or AF Overscan is set.</p>"
"</body></html>"
