#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, focusTimeDilation)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocusprocess.ui:755
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The furthest datapoints have their exposure times increased by this factor. The in focus datapoint exposure is not increased. Intermediate points have their exposures scaled appropriately.</p>"
