#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:232
#, kde-format
msgid "Suspend Guiding while autofocus in progress"
msgstr "Suspender a guía durante o proceso de enfocar automaticamente."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, focusSuspendGuiding)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:235
#, kde-format
msgid "Suspend Guiding"
msgstr "Suspender a guía."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:248
#, kde-format
msgid "Optimize AF:"
msgstr "Optimizar o enfoque automático:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusAFOptimize)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:261
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Create an &quot;optimization zone&quot; of this many seconds. When an automated Autofocus run is requested by another process, e.g. Scheduler or Capture, a check is performed on the timestamp of the last successful Autofocus for that filter. If we are within the optimization zone then no Autofocus is run; if outside the zone, Autofocus is run as normal.</p>"
"<p>Note that filter offsets and Adaptive Focus settings are always honoured.</p>"
"<p>Set to zero to disable this feature.</p>"
"<p>NOTE: manually initiated runs will always be performed.</p>"
"<p>This is currently an experimental feature enabled for Linear and Linear 1 Pass only.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Crear unha «zona de optimización» con esta cantidade de segundos. Cando outro proceso solicita unha execución automatizada do enfoque automático, p. ex. o planificador ou a captura, realízase unha comprobación da data e hora do último enfoque automático do filtro correspondente. En caso de estar dentro da zona de optimización, non se executa o enfoque automático; se está fóra da zona, o enfoque automático execútase como normalmente.</p>"
"<p>Teña en conta que sempre se respectan os desprazamentos do filtro e as opcións de enfoque adaptativo.</p>"
"<p>Defínase co valor 0 para desactivar a funcionalidade.</p>"
"<p>Nota: as execucións iniciadas manualmente sempre se realizan.</p>"
"<p>Actualmente esta funcionalidade é experimental, e só está activada para «Linear» e «1 pasada linear».</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, focusMosaicMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:295
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Aberration inspector style mask with a 3x3 mosaic formed with tiles from the center, the corners and the edges.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Máscara de estilo do inspector de aberración cun mosaico de 3×3 formado por teselas do centro, das esquinas e dos bordos.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, focusMosaicMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:298
#, kde-format
msgid "Mosaic Mask:"
msgstr "Máscara de mosaico:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, focusRingMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:311
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>During Full Field focusing, this controls the size of an Annulus centred at the middle of the sensor to include for processing. Set inner % to zero to include the centre of the sensor and set outer % to 100 to include the outer edges of the sensor. </p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Durante o enfoque de «campo completo», isto controla o tamaño dunha coroa circular centrada no medio do sensor para incluír par ao procesamento. Defina a porcentaxe interna a cero para incluír o centro do sensor e defina a porcentaxe externa a cero para incluír os bordos externos do sensor.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, focusRingMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:314
#, kde-format
msgid "Ring Mask:"
msgstr "Máscara de anel:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusMosaicSpace)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:330
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Size of the separator between the tiles.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Tamaño do separador entre teselas.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusMosaicTileWidth)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:355
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Tiles are squares with an edge length calculated by the given percentage of the image width. The percentage is limited such that the tile size does not exceed one third of the shorter side of the image (in most cases, it's height).</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>As teselas son cadrados cunha lonxitude de bordos calculada aplicando a porcentaxe indicada pola anchura da imaxe. A porcentaxe está limitada de xeito que o tamaño da tesela non supera un terzo do lado máis curto da imaxe (na meirande parte dos casos, é a altura).</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, focusFullFieldInnerRadius)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:389
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Diameter of the inner circle to be excluded from focusing (e.g. a centered galaxy or star cluster). The diameter is given as percentage of the image diagonal. Set to zero to include the centre of the sensor.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Diámetro do círculo interno para excluír do enfoque (p. ex. unha galaxia centrada ou un cúmulo estelar). O diámetro indícase como porcentaxe da diagonal da imaxe. Use cero para incluír o centro do sensor.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, focusSpacerLabel)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:414
#, kde-format
msgid "Spacer:"
msgstr "Espazador:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, focusNoMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:430
#, kde-format
msgid "All stars are used for focusing."
msgstr "Úsanse todas as estrelas para enfocar."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, focusNoMaskRB)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:433
#, kde-format
msgid "Use all stars for focusing"
msgstr "Usar todas as estrelas para enfocar"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, focusFullFieldOuterRadius)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:449
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Diameter of the outer circle to be excluded from focusing. The diameter is given as percentage of the image diagonal. Set to 100% to include the outer edges of the sensor. </p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Diámetro do círculo externo para excluír do enfoque. O diámetro indícase como porcentaxe da diagonal da imaxe. Use 100% para incluír os bordos externos do sensor.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusAdaptiveMinMove)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:510
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The minimum size of an adaptive focus change that will be sent to the focuser.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O tamaño mínimo de cambio de enfoque adaptativo que se enviará ao enfocador.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (suffix), widget (QSpinBox, focusAdaptiveMinMove)
#. i18n: ectx: property (suffix), widget (QSpinBox, focusAdaptiveMaxMove)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:513 ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:538
#, kde-format
