msgstr " marcas"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, focusAdaptiveMaxMove)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:535
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>The maximum total Adaptive focuser movement between Autofocus runs.  If this value is hit,  adaptive focusing is suspended.  The purpose of this control is to handle runaway adaptive focusing.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O movemento total máximo do enfocador adaptativo entre execucións do enfoque automático. Ao chegarse a este valor suspéndese o enfoque adaptativo. O propósito deste control é manexar o enfoque adaptativo de fuxida.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, focusAdaptive)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:560
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Enable Adaptive Focus between subframes. This is an experimental feature.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Activar o enfoque adaptativo entre recortes. Isto é unha funcionalidade experimental.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_7)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/focus/opsfocussettings.ui:576
#, kde-format
