msgstr "Configuración avanzada"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas0a)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_GPGSE0KLengthScale)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:342 ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:360
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Length scale of the long range kernel in seconds.</p>"
"<p>This \n"
"          parameter accounts for the long-term drift in periodic error, on the scale of several major periods. This might be due to, for\n"
"          example:</p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent:\n"
"          1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">Harmonic interaction between the gears in the whole gear train,</li>"
"<li style=\"\n"
"          margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Change in\n"
"          loading due to gravity,</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;\n"
"          -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Thermal variations.</li>"
"</ul>"
"<p>This should probably be several\n"
"          times larger than the major period.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Escala de duración en segundos do núcleo de longo alcance.</p>"
"<p>Este parámetro compensa a deriva a longo prazo do erro periódico, á escala de varios períodos principais. Pode deberse, por exemplo, a:</p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent:\n"
"          1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">a interacción harmónica entre engrenaxes no tren de engrenaxes,</li>"
"<li style=\"\n"
"          margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">un cambio na carga pola gravidade, ou</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;\n"
"          -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">variacións térmicas.</li>"
"</ul>"
"<p>Isto debería ser varias veces superior ao período principal.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas0a)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:345
#, kde-format
msgid "Long-range Length Scale"
msgstr "Escala de lonxitude de longo alcance"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas1a)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, kcfg_GPGSE0KSignalVariance)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:382 ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:394
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Long-range kernel signal variance.</p>"
"<p>This describes how \n"
"          much the error changes over the long-term time scale. A higher variance means a larger change in error, on\n"
"          average.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Varianza de sinal do núcleo de longo alcance.</p>"
"<p>Isto describe canto cambia o erro na escala de tempo a longo prazo. Unha varianza maior implica un cambio de erro maior, de media.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas1a)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:385
#, kde-format
msgid "Long-range Variance"
msgstr "Varianza de longo alcance"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas2a)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_GPGPKLengthScale)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:420 ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:433
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Periodic Kernel length scale, in seconds.</p>"
"<p>This \n"
"          describes how quickly the error changes within a single period. It can be thought of as the wavelength of the noise component\n"
"          above which the noise becomes unpredictable. A higher length scale means the predictable error has less high-frequency\n"
"          components; a shorter length-scale means it has more.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Escala de duración en segundos do núcleo periódico.</p>"
"<p>Isto describe a velocidade coa que cambia o erro nun mesmo período. Pode imaxinala como unha lonxitude de onda da compoñente de ruído a partir da cal o ruído se volve imprevisíbel. Unha maior escala de duración significa que o erro previsíbel ten menos compoñentes de alta frecuencia; unha menor significa que ten máis.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas2a)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:423
#, kde-format
msgid "Periodic Length Scale"
msgstr "Escala de lonxitude periódica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas3a)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QDoubleSpinBox, kcfg_GPGPKSignalVariance)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:454 ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:465
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Periodic kernel signal variance.</p>"
"<p>This describes how \n"
"          much the error changes during the periodic length scale.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Varianza de sinal do núcleo periódico.</p>"
"<p>Isto describe canto cambia o erro durante a escala de duración periódica.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas3a)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:457
#, kde-format
msgid "Periodic Variance"
msgstr "Varianza periódica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label_gpgas4a)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_GPGSE1KLengthScale)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:497 ekos/guide/opsgpg.ui:516
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Length scale of the short-range kernel in \n"
"          seconds.</p>"
"<p>This is a measure of the scale of the non-periodic short-term noise, caused by things such\n"
"          as:</p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent:\n"
"          1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">Grit in the gearchain,</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px;\n"
"          margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Wind gusts,</li>"
"<li style=\"\n"
"          margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">Structural vibrations, such as footsteps or traffic,</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px;\n"
"          margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Swinging or dragging\n"
"          cables.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>A escala de lonxitude do núcleo de curto alcance en segundos.</p>"
"<p>Isto é unha medida da escala do ruído non periódico a curto prazo, que poden causar, entre outras cousas:</p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent:\n"
"          1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">sucidade no tren de engrenaxes,</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px;\n"
"          margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">refachos,</li>"
"<li style=\"\n"
"          margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0;\n"
"          text-indent:0px;\">vibracións estruturais, como pegadas ou tráfico,</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px;\n"
"          margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">cables colgando ou arrastrándose.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</body></html>"

