#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, remoteDriversLabel)
#. +> trunk5
#: ekos/profileeditor.ui:477
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Add remote INDI drivers to chain with the local INDI server configured by this profile. Format this field as a comma-separated list of quoted driver name, host name/address and optional port:</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">&quot;ZWO ASI120MC&quot;@192.168.1.50:8000</span><br/>"
"Connect to the named camera on 192.168.1.50, port 8000.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">&quot;EQMod Mount&quot;@192.168.1.50</span><br/>"
"Connect to the named mount on 192.168.1.50, port 7624.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">@192.168.1.50:8000</span><br/>"
"Connect to all drivers found on 192.168.1.50, port 8000.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">@192.168.1.50</span><br/>"
"Connect to all drivers found on 192.168.1.50, port 7624.</p>"
"<p>When omitted, host defaults to localhost and port defaults to 7624.<br/>"
"Remote INDI drivers must be already running for the connection to succeed.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Engadir controladores de INDI remotos para encadear co servidor de INDI local configurado neste perfil. Formate este campo como lista separada por comas de nomes de controlador entre comiñas, servidor ou enderezo, e porto opcional:</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">&quot;ZWO ASI120MC&quot;@192.168.1.50:8000</span><br/>"
"Conectar á cámara nomeada en 192.168.1.50, porto 8000.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">&quot;EQMod Mount&quot;@192.168.1.50</span><br/>"
"Conectar á montura nomeada en 192.168.1.50, porto 7624.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">@192.168.1.50:8000</span><br/>"
"Conectar a todos os controladores atopados en 192.168.1.50, porto 8000.</p>"
"<p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">@192.168.1.50</span><br/>"
"Conectar a todos os controladores atopados en 192.168.1.50, porto 7624.</p>"
"<p>Cando se omiten, o servidor predeterminado é localhost e o porto 7624.<br/>"
"Os controladores de INDI remotos deben estar xa en execución para que a conexión funcione.</p>"
"</body></html>"

