#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DSOCachePercentage), group (Catalogs)
#. +> trunk5
#: kstars.kcfg:145
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The DSOs are loaded from a sqlite database and\n"
"         cached in memory. This setting regulates how much of the DSOs\n"
"         will be cached. Turning this value up yields better\n"
"         performance at the cost of memory."
