#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:745
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "Select this for erect view of the sky map, where north (in Equatorial Coordinate mode) or zenith (in Horizontal Coordinate mode) is vertically up. This would be the natural choice for an erect image finder scope or naked-eye view."
msgstr "Seleccione isto para unha vista erecta do mapa celeste, onde o norte (no modo de coordenada ecuatorial) ou o cénit (no modo de coordenada horizontal) está arriba na vertical. Isto sería a escolla natural para unha mira de buscador de imaxe erecta ou para a simple vista."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:754
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "Select this for inverted view of the sky map, where north (in Equatorial Coordinate mode) or zenith (in Horizontal Coordinate mode) is vertically down. This would be the natural choice for an inverted image finder scope, refractor/cassegrain without erector prism, or Dobsonian."
msgstr "Seleccione isto para inverter a vista do mapa celeste, onde o norte (no modo de coordenada ecuatorial) ou o cénit (no modo de coordenada horizontal) está abaixo na vertical. Isto sería a escolla natural para unha mira de buscador de imaxe invertida, refractor ou Cassegrain sen prisma erecto, ou de Dobson."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:759
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map is arbitrary as it has been adjusted by the user"
msgid "Arbitrary"
msgstr "Arbitraria"

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:763
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "This mode is selected automatically if you manually rotated the sky map using Shift + Drag mouse action, to inform you that the orientation is arbitrary"
msgstr "Este modo selecciónase automaticamente se rota manualmente o mapa celeste coa acción de rato Maiús + arrastrar, para informarlle de que a orientación é arbitraria."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:770
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Do not adjust the orientation of the sky map for an erect observer"
msgid "No correction"
msgstr "Sen corrección"

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:774
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "Select this if you are using a camera on the telescope, or have the sky map display mounted on your telescope"
msgstr "Seleccione isto se está a usar unha cámara no telescopio, ou ten a visualización do mapa celeste montada no telescopio."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:780
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Adjust the orientation of the sky map for an erect observer, left-handed telescope"
msgid "Erect observer correction, left-handed"
msgstr "Corrección do observador erecto, zurda"

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:784
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "Select this if you are visually observing using a Dobsonian telescope which has the focuser appearing on the left side when looking up the telescope tube. This feature will correct the orientation of the sky-map to account for the observer remaining erect as the telescope moves up and down, unlike a camera which would rotate with the telescope. Typically makes sense to combine this with Zenith Down orientation."
msgstr "Seleccione isto se observa visualmente cun telescopio de Dobson cun enfocador que aparece na parte esquerda ao mirar polo tubo do telescopio. Esta funcionalidade corrixirá a orientación do mapa celeste para ter en conta que o observador permaneza erecto a medida que o telescopio sube ou baixa, a diferenza da cámara, que rotaría co telescopio. Adoita ter sentido combinar isto coa orientación do cénit abaixo."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:790
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Adjust the orientation of the sky map for an erect observer, left-handed telescope"
msgid "Erect observer correction, right-handed"
msgstr "Corrección do observador erecto, destra"

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:794
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Orientation of the sky map"
msgid "Select this if you are visually observing using a Dobsonian telescope which has the focuser appearing on the right side when looking up the telescope tube. This feature will correct the orientation of the sky-map to account for the observer remaining erect as the telescope moves up and down, unlike a camera which would rotate with the telescope. Typically makes sense to combine this with Zenith Down orientation."
msgstr "Seleccione isto se observa visualmente cun telescopio de Dobson cun enfocador que aparece na parte dereita ao mirar polo tubo do telescopio. Esta funcionalidade corrixirá a orientación do mapa celeste para ter en conta que o observador permaneza erecto a medida que o telescopio sube ou baixa, a diferenza da cámara, que rotaría co telescopio. Adoita ter sentido combinar isto coa orientación do cénit abaixo."

#. +> trunk5
#: kstarsinit.cpp:818
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Arbitrary Sky Map View"
msgid "Arbitrary"
msgstr "Arbitraria"

