#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk5
#: tools/horizonmanager.ui:400
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>Artificial horizon is used to define <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Regions</span> on the SkyMap that are <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">blocked</span> from view from your vantage point (e.g. by tall trees or buildings). Regions can be areas above or below line segments that you enter. </p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">To draw a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Region</span>, enter a list of <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Points</span> (<span style=\" font-style:italic;\">minimum</span> 2) that outlines the top of a blocked area (the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">blockage is below</span> the lines).</li>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Setting <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">ceiling/window mode</span> for a list of points instead sets the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">blockage above</span> the lines.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Add the points manually, or preferably by selecting them from the Sky Map after clicking <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Select Points</span> button. </li>"
"</ul>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Enable a region by <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">checking its box</span>. </li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Selecting a region displays its points on the SkyMap. </li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">When done click <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Apply</span>.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Defining regions is easier when used in conjunction with the Terrain background feature.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">You can export (and later import) regions using the export/import region buttons.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>O horizonte artificial úsase para definir <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rexións</span> no mapa celeste que <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">non poden verse</span> desde onde estás (p. ex. por mor de árbores ou edificios). As rexións poden ser zonas sobre ou baixo segmentos que insira.</p>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Para debuxar unha <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rexión</span>, insira unha lista de <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">puntos</span> (2 como <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">mínimo</span>) que describan a parte superior da zona bloqueada (<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">o bloqueo está debaixo</span> dos segmentos).</li>"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Definir o <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">modo de teito ou xanela</span> para unha lista de puntos fai que <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">o bloqueo estea debaixo</span> dos segmentos.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Engada os puntos manualmente, ou a poder ser seleccionándoos no mapa celeste tras premer o botón <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Seleccionar os puntos</span>. </li>"
"</ul>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Para activar unha rexión <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">marque a súa caixa</span>. </li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Ao seleccionar unha rexión, os seus puntos amósanse no mapa celeste. </li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Cando remate, prema <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Aplicar</span>.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Definir rexións é máis doado cando se fai xunto coa funcionalidade de fondo de terreo.</li>"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Pode exportar (e despois importar) rexións mediante os botóns de rexións de exportar e importar.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</body></html>"

