#~ msgid ""
#~ "<html><head/><body>"
#~ "<p>A good figure to start with is 5. An exception is if you have a scope with a central obstruction that turns stars to donuts when they are out of focus. When this happens the system will struggle to identify stars correctly. To avoid this situation reduce either the step size or the number of steps.</p>"
#~ "<p>To check this situation, start at focus and move away by &quot;step size&quot; * &quot;number of steps&quot; steps. Take a focus frame and zoom in on the fitsviewer to see whether stars appear as stars or donuts.</p>"
#~ "</body></html>"
#~ msgstr ""
